# script/release.env — local overrides for the dmg release pipeline.
#
# Copy to `script/release.env` (gitignored) ONLY if you need to override the
# defaults. None of these are secrets:
#   - The signing identity is public (it's embedded in every signed binary).
#   - The notary profile is just a keychain label; the real notary credential
#     (.p8 / key-id / issuer) lives in the macOS keychain, set once via
#     `xcrun notarytool store-credentials <profile>`.
#
# By default you need NOTHING here:
#   - the signing identity is auto-derived from the single "Developer ID
#     Application" identity in your keychain;
#   - the notary profile defaults to "openbird-notary".
# Set a value below only to override (e.g. multiple Developer ID identities).

# OPENBIRD_SIGN_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)"
# OPENBIRD_NOTARY_PROFILE="openbird-notary"
# OPENBIRD_DMG_PY_VERSION="3.13"
# OPENBIRD_DMG_EXTRAS="encryption,integrations,meetings-mlx"
